"><span style="color:#0f0f0f;font-family:'Aspira',sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:174%">The chart below reflects the relationship between the PEO and average non-PEO NEO CAP and our GAAP Net Income.</span></div><div style="margin-bottom:15pt;text-align:center"><img src="chgg-20230420_g58.jpg" alt="2748779090886" style="height:375px;margin-bottom:5pt;vertical-align:text-bottom;width:613px"/></div></ix:nonNumeric><div style="height:45pt;position:relative;width:100%"><div style="bottom:0;position:absolute;width:100%"><div style="margin-bottom:6pt;text-align:center"><table style="border-collapse:collapse;display:inline-table;margin-bottom:5pt;vertical-align:text-bottom;width:99.856%"><tr><td style="width:1.0%"></td><td style="width:45.087%"></td><td style="width:0.1%"></td><td style="width:1.0%"></td><td style="width:6.525%"></td><td style="width:0.1%"></td><td style="width:1.0%"></td><td style="width:45.088%"></td><td style="width:0.1%"></td></tr><tr><td colspan="3" style="padding:2px 1pt;text-align:right;vertical-align:middle"><span style="color:#eb7100;font-family:'Aspira',sans-serif;font-size:7pt;font-weight:700;line-height:120%">Chegg, Inc.</span></td><td colspan="3" style="padding:2px 1pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:middle"><div style="text-align:center"><span style="color:#0f0f0f;font-family:'Aspira',sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-weight:700;line-height:120%">84</span></div></td><td colspan="3" style="padding:2px 1pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:middle"><span style="color:#0f0f0f;font-family:'Aspira',sans-serif;font-size:7pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">Proxy Statement for the 2023 Annual Meeting of Stockholders</span></td></tr></table></div></div></div><hr style="page-break-after:always"/><div style="min-height:36pt;width:100%"><div style="text-align:right"><span style="color:#0f0f0f;font-family:'Aspira',sans-serif;font-size:7pt;font-weight:700;line-height:120%">PAY VERSUS PERFORMANCE DISCLOSURE</span></div></div><div style="margin-