style="width:45.024%"></td><td style="width:0.1%"></td></tr><tr><td colspan="3" style="padding:2px 1pt;text-align:right;vertical-align:middle"><span style="color:#eb7100;font-family:'Aspira',sans-serif;font-size:7pt;font-weight:700;line-height:120%">Chegg, Inc.</span></td><td colspan="3" style="padding:0 1pt"></td><td colspan="3" style="padding:2px 1pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:middle"><div style="text-align:center"><span style="color:#0f0f0f;font-family:'Aspira',sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-weight:700;line-height:120%">A-1</span></div></td><td colspan="3" style="padding:0 1pt"></td><td colspan="3" style="padding:2px 1pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:middle"><span style="color:#0f0f0f;font-family:'Aspira',sans-serif;font-size:7pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">Proxy Statement for the 2023 Annual Meeting of Stockholders</span></td></tr></table></div></div></div><hr style="page-break-after:always"/><div style="min-height:36pt;width:100%"><div style="text-align:right"><span style="color:#0f0f0f;font-family:'Aspira',sans-serif;font-size:7pt;font-weight:700;line-height:120%">APPENDIX A</span></div></div><div style="margin-bottom:6pt"><span style="color:#0f0f0f;font-family:'Aspira',sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:174%">The following is a reconciliation of net cash provided by operating activities to free cash flow for the year ended December&#160;31, 2022 (in thousands, unaudited):</span></div><div><table style="border-collapse:collapse;display:inline-table;margin-bottom:5pt;vertical-align:text-bottom;width:100.000%"><tr><td style="width:1.0%"></td><td style="width:72.319%"></td><td style="width:0.1%"></td><td style="width:0.1%"></td><td style="width:0.374%"></td><td style="width:0.1%"></td><td colspan="3" style="display:none"></td><td colspan="3" style="display:none"></td><td colspan="3" style="display:none"></td><td colspan="3" style="display:none"></td><td style="width:1.0%"></td><td style="width:24.907%"></td><td style="width:0.1%"></td>